ss- eller personuppgifter. Personuppgifter är markerade som [innehåller personuppgifter].\n\nInformationen publiceras i tabellform och innehåller:\n\n- verifikationsnummer (Varbergs kommuns egen numrering)\n- leverantörens namn\n- leverantörens organisationsnummer\n- konto\n- kontotext (anger i klartext vilken slags kostnad det gäller)\n- konterat belopp exklusive moms\n- bokföringsdatum\n- förvaltning\n- fakturanummer"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120001249"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"https://sws.geonames.org/2664994"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:27a20f6da246b1097173f9714087a421da09878ba25bfe304ba710786d9de4b5_b2n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Leverantörsfakturor 2026"}},{"@id":"https://editera.dataportal.se/store/167/resource/51","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":[{"@id":"_:27a20f6da246b1097173f9714087a421da09878ba25bfe304ba710786d9de4b5_b3n0"},{"@id":"https://varberg.se/download/18.212af18e19bdd1d7e7384292/1773301047940/Leverant%C3%B6rsreskontra2026.csv"}],"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/specifications/leverantorsreskontra/latest"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Leverantörsfakturor 2026, CSV"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/available"}},{"@id":"https://editera.dataportal.se/store/87/resource/1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Mattias Axell","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":[{"@id":"_:27a20f6da246b1097173f9714087a421da09878ba25bfe304ba710786d9de4b5_b4n0"},{"@id":"_:27a20f6da246b1097173f9714087a421da09878ba25bfe304ba710786d9de4b5_b5n0"}],"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:mattias@metasolutions.se"}},{"@id":"https://editera.dataportal.se/store/87/resource/2","@type":"http://www.w3.org/200